Time of Day: Day vs. night games and their impact on performance.​

Starting Pitcher: The opposing pitcher's statistics and performance.​

Average RBIs per At-Bat: The batter's historical RBI rate per at-bat.​

Lineup Position: The batter's spot in the batting order, affecting RBI opportunities. ​
